<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia DMIB 6-mth net at 15.0 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia DMIB 6-mth net at 15.0 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, '96</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  15.0    vs	  15.8</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  5.0    vs	   5.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   235.2    vs	 210.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    17.6    vs	  19.7</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 3.0    vs	   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE - DMIB Bhd makes tyres, mattresses and chemical and rubber products. It is a subsidiary of Sime Darby Bhd .</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
